# Testing crate (`testing/`)

- Integration tests expect **SurrealDB + Redis + API** as documented. Use **`./ci-local.sh integration prod`** (starts stack), or **`./scripts/start-back.sh`** then **`./scripts/run-integration-tests.sh`**. Quick path: **`./ci-local.sh smoke prod`**.
- Prefer env/ports from **`config/`** and **`scripts/load-env.sh`** so tests match CI.
- When assertions involve API contracts, align types with **`shared/`** and **`back/api`** rather than duplicating ad-hoc structs.
